{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-EXERCISE-246YG","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-HINT-246YG-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 246Yg","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-SEG-246YG","semantic_anchor":"246Yg","source_anchor":"246Yg","source_line_start":828,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"96423f324fcb7b01de1f041a9f0a906a5acccc2c03cb534b9b71b16f646acaf6","source_text":"suppose otherwise.   By taking\nsuitable subsequences reduce to the case in which\n$|\\nu_nF_i-\\nu F_i|\\le 2^{-n}\\epsilon$ for $i<n$,\n$|\\nu_nF_n|\\ge 3\\epsilon$,\n$|\\nu_nF_i|\\le 2^{-i}\\epsilon$ for $i>n$.   Set\n$F=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\Bbb N}F_{2i+1}$ and show that\n$|\\nu_{2n+1}F-\\nu_{2n}F|\\ge\\epsilon$ for every $n$.","target_line_start":827,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"5cde30d3ee0a123cb57734819c05abdd0a7fbef8790b502333efd0c6b29bddda","target_text":"Andaikan sebaliknya. Dengan\nmengambil subbarisan yang sesuai, cukup tinjau kasus ketika $|\\nu_nF_i-\\nu\nF_i|\\le 2^{-n}\\epsilon$ untuk $i<n$, $|\\nu_nF_n|\\ge 3\\epsilon$, $|\\nu_nF_i|\\le\n2^{-i}\\epsilon$ untuk $i>n$. Tetapkan $F=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\Bbb N}F_{2i+1}$ dan\ntunjukkan bahwa $|\\nu_{2n+1}F-\\nu_{2n}F|\\ge\\epsilon$ untuk setiap $n$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-EXERCISE-246YH","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-HINT-246YH-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 246Yh","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-SEG-246YH","semantic_anchor":"246Yh","source_anchor":"246Yh","source_line_start":840,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"5c7c9f12ddc41ba7a8f55ab47d7cf059400a8a6824237ad85f037d06c4592163","source_text":"suppose not.\nThen there are a disjoint sequence $\\sequencen{F_n}$ in $\\Sigma$ and a\nsubsequence $\\sequencen{u'_n}$ of $\\sequencen{u_n}$ such that\n$\\inf_{n\\in\\Bbb N}|\\int_{F_n}u'_n|=\\epsilon>0$.   But this contradicts\n246Yg.","target_line_start":838,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"fd3aa52140fa0b0cfbca3c07fa01a8f6eff9f81a10f182d44ddee1c948c7aaed","target_text":"Andaikan tidak. Maka terdapat barisan saling lepas\n$\\sequencen{F_n}$ dalam $\\Sigma$ dan subbarisan $\\sequencen{u'_n}$ dari\n$\\sequencen{u_n}$ sehingga $\\inf_{n\\in\\Bbb N}|\\int_{F_n}u'_n|=\\epsilon>0$.\nTetapi ini bertentangan dengan 246Yg.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-EXERCISE-246YI","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-HINT-246YI-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 246Yi","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-SEG-246YI","semantic_anchor":"246Yi","source_anchor":"246Yi","source_line_start":848,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"439b3c9fc42326ce0dde58f9e2a93c80d60ecac9338b6508163e39279f191275","source_text":"Set $\\mu=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}a_n\\nu_n$ for a suitable sequence\n$\\sequencen{a_n}$ of strictly positive numbers.   For each $n$ choose a\nRadon-Nikod\\'ym derivative $f_n$ of $\\nu_n$ with respect to $\\mu$.\nShow that $\\{f_n:n\\in\\Bbb N\\}$ is uniformly integrable, so that $\\nu$ is\ntruly continuous.","target_line_start":845,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"e222a8f3f674d249485711f0231c13d60119feea3659ae76fdaa44b13a533be3","target_text":"Tetapkan $\\mu=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}a_n|\\nu_n|$ untuk suatu barisan\n$\\sequencen{a_n}$ bilangan positif tegas yang sesuai. Untuk\nsetiap $n$ pilih turunan Radon-Nikod\\'ym $f_n$ dari $\\nu_n$ terhadap $\\mu$.\nTunjukkan bahwa $\\{f_n:n\\in\\Bbb N\\}$ terintegralkan secara seragam, sehingga\n$\\nu$ kontinu sejati.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-EXERCISE-246YJ","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-HINT-246YJ-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 246Yj","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-SEG-246YJ","semantic_anchor":"246Yj","source_anchor":"246Yj","source_line_start":861,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"fe7d989a73d6c789e248ff6b60ecfbea232891fba00739067e1a8331c428a684","source_text":"show\nthat $\\sequencen{a_nu_n}$ is uniformly integrable whenever\n$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=0$ in $\\Bbb R$ and $\\sequencen{u_n}$ is a sequence\nin $A$.","target_line_start":860,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"0570936abe574b1beeac8381f0a1d5b354dd102a89ad47ecfd8694059b763cd3","target_text":" tunjukkan bahwa\n$\\sequencen{a_nu_n}$ terintegralkan secara seragam bila\n$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=0$ dalam $\\Bbb R$ dan $\\sequencen{u_n}$ suatu barisan\ndalam $A$. ","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-EXERCISE-246YK","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-HINT-246YK-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 246Yk","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246-SEG-246YK","semantic_anchor":"246Yk","source_anchor":"246Yk","source_line_start":873,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"2f81eb6fc449ff5eebdbbe3629615b124876fa400f522b4044522c5f86f6cd60","source_text":"for (i)$\\Rightarrow$(ii), note that $\\inf_{v\\in B}w\\times\nv=0$ for every $w\\ge 0$ in $L^0$.   For (ii)$\\Rightarrow$(i), use\n246G(iv).","target_line_start":873,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"8d91161d00df9c539627962da3217549e0c882c02e5201a4201618b62929202b","target_text":"Untuk (i)$\\Rightarrow$(ii), catat bahwa $\\inf_{v\\in B}w\\times\nv=0$ untuk setiap $w\\ge 0$ dalam $L^0$. Untuk (ii)$\\Rightarrow$(i), gunakan\n246G(iv).","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246"}
